{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"entity entity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md","fileName":"Entity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Entity","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 16:28\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Natural Language Understanding Systems]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Natural Language Understanding Systems","Named Entity Recognition","Meaning Representation","Dialog Manager","aiassistants.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"entity entity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md","fileName":"Entity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Entity","heading":"Entity","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An entity is a meaningful value extracted from an utterance to fill an argument of an intent. People, places, dates, quantities, and product names are common entity types.\n\n[[Named Entity Recognition]] locates and labels these spans. The resulting values become slots in a [[Meaning Representation]] that the [[Dialog Manager]] can validate, request, or pass to a service.\n\nIn the book's DDD treatment, an entity has continuity through identity even as its attributes change. Business behavior should protect that identity and the rules governing state changes rather than reducing the entity to a database row carrier.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Natural Language Understanding Systems","Named Entity Recognition","Meaning Representation","Dialog Manager","aiassistants.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Entity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","so